# A full-stack CRUD application to manage bookmarks.

## Live Demo
https://smart-bookmark-app-i7fd.onrender.com

## GitHub Repository
https://github.com/bhavani267/smart-bookmark-app

## Features
- Add Bookmark (Title & URL)
- View All Bookmarks
- Update Bookmark
- Delete Bookmark
- Live Deployment on Render

## Tech Stack
- Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript
- Backend: Node.js, Express
- Database: In-memory / JSON
- Deployment: Render

